{
  "_comment": "The bestiary. Stats for the 52 monsters added 2026-08-26 are Claude's PROPOSALS scaled from the original rat/goblin/skeleton/orc curve — retune freely! 'slow' monsters have speed 2 (act on even rounds). 'inflicts' rides a hit: condition id from conditions.json, rounds, save DC. Sprites in assets/enemies/gen/ come from the art pipeline (data/art_manifest.json + tools/genart.py); a missing image just renders empty. SPECIAL ABILITIES (2026-09-01, the designer's danger pass — all numbers PROPOSALS, retune freely): 'attacks': N = swings per turn (elites). 'abilities': [ordered list = AI priority; first usable fires] with types 'bolt' (one hero: name, element?, dice, range, save, dc, cooldown/uses, fx like spells.json), 'breath' (adds 'area' — every hero within it of the target), 'afflict' (condition id + rounds + dc at range; 'area' for a blast; targets:'party' = every hero saves alone; uses:1 for once-a-battle), 'haste' (targets 'self'|'allies': extra_attacks for rounds — kill the pack leader!), 'spell' (id + caster_level: casts a REAL spells.json damage/afflict spell — the lich). 'regen': {amount, blocked_by:[elements]} — fire sears a troll shut. 'drains': {amount: dice|'level'|'damage', dc, heals?} — failed CON save tears away MAX HP until a full rest or the temple ('level' = a class hit die, 'damage' = what the blow dealt, heals = the vampire drinks it). 'death_burst': {dice, element?, area, save, dc} — the corpse detonates. 'resist_physical': ['edged'|'piercing'|'blunt'] — half damage from those weapons (bring a mace). 'touch': true — the blow ignores worn armor and shield AC (incorporeal). | 'magic_to_hit': true — mundane weapons pass straight through; only 'enchanted' weapons (tier 2+) or spells can harm it. Designer ruling 2026-08-27: incorporeal undead + outsiders (fiends, genies, slaadi, elementals). The exact list is a Claude PROPOSAL — add/remove freely. | 'family' (tier abilities 2026-08-27): every monster's kind — undead/outsider/beast/vermin/humanoid/construct/ooze/aberration/dragon/elemental; Ancient weapons double vs undead, Bane vs outsider. 'element' on a monster types its ATTACK (fire/frost/lightning/poison) so worn resist halves it and immunity drinks it. All tags are Claude PROPOSALS — retag freely. | 'fear_aura': {dc, rounds} (2026-09-02, designer) — stepping next to the bearer, or starting a turn beside it, demands a WIS save vs dc; failing = frightened (and fear is behavioral: no approach). One passed save steels that hero against that monster for the battle.",
